{"suttaId":"tha-ap492","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2423,2521],"vripara":"190"},"segments":{"tha-ap492:0.3":"Sālamaṇḍapiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap492:1.1":"“Ajjhogāhetvā sālavanaṃ, sukato assamo mama;","tha-ap492:1.3":"Sālapupphehi sañchanno, vasāmi vipine tadā.","tha-ap492:2.1":"“Piyadassī ca bhagavā, sayambhū aggapuggalo;","tha-ap492:2.3":"Vivekakāmo sambuddho, sālavanamupāgami.","tha-ap492:3.1":"“Assamā abhinikkhamma, pavanaṃ agamāsahaṃ;","tha-ap492:3.3":"Mūlaphalaṃ gavesanto, āhiṇḍāmi vane tadā.","tha-ap492:4.1":"“Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, piyadassiṃ mahāyasaṃ;","tha-ap492:4.3":"Sunisinnaṃ samāpannaṃ, virocantaṃ mahāvane.","tha-ap492:5.1":"“Catudaṇḍe ṭhapetvāna, buddhassa uparī ahaṃ;","tha-ap492:5.3":"Maṇḍapaṃ sukataṃ katvā, sālapupphehi chādayiṃ.","tha-ap492:6.1":"“Sattāhaṃ dhārayitvāna, maṇḍapaṃ sālachāditaṃ;","tha-ap492:6.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, buddhaseṭṭhamavandahaṃ.","tha-ap492:7.1":"“Bhagavā tamhi samaye, vuṭṭhahitvā samādhito;","tha-ap492:7.3":"Yugamattaṃ pekkhamāno, nisīdi purisuttamo.","tha-ap492:8.1":"“Sāvako varuṇo nāma, piyadassissa satthuno;","tha-ap492:8.3":"Vasīsatasahassehi, upagacchi vināyakaṃ.","tha-ap492:9.1":"“Piyadassī ca bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap492:9.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, sitaṃ pātukarī jino.","tha-ap492:10.1":"“Anuruddho upaṭṭhāko, piyadassissa satthuno;","tha-ap492:10.3":"Ekaṃsaṃ cīvaraṃ katvā, apucchittha mahāmuniṃ.","tha-ap492:11.1":"“‘Ko nu kho bhagavā hetu, sitakammassa satthuno;","tha-ap492:11.3":"Kāraṇe vijjamānamhi, satthā pātukare sitaṃ’.","tha-ap492:12.1":"“‘Sattāhaṃ sālacchadanaṃ [pupphachadanaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)], yo me dhāresi māṇavo;","tha-ap492:12.3":"Tassa kammaṃ saritvāna, sitaṃ pātukariṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap492:13.1":"“‘Anokāsaṃ na passāmi, yattha [yaṃ taṃ (syā. pī. ka.)] puññaṃ vipaccati;","tha-ap492:13.3":"Devaloke manusse vā, okāsova na sammati.","tha-ap492:14.1":"“‘Devaloke vasantassa, puññakammasamaṅgino;","tha-ap492:14.3":"Yāvatā parisā tassa, sālacchannā bhavissati.","tha-ap492:15.1":"“‘Tattha dibbehi naccehi, gītehi vāditehi ca;","tha-ap492:15.3":"Ramissati sadā santo, puññakammasamāhito.","tha-ap492:16.1":"“‘Yāvatā parisā tassa, gandhagandhī bhavissati;","tha-ap492:16.3":"Sālassa pupphavasso ca, pavassissati tāvade.","tha-ap492:17.1":"“‘Tato cutoyaṃ manujo, mānusaṃ āgamissati;","tha-ap492:17.3":"Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, sabbakālaṃ dharissati [dhariyati (sī. pī.)].","tha-ap492:18.1":"“‘Idha naccañca gītañca, sammatāḷasamāhitaṃ;","tha-ap492:18.3":"Parivāressanti maṃ niccaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap492:19.1":"“‘Uggacchante ca sūriye, sālavassaṃ pavassati;","tha-ap492:19.3":"Puññakammena saṃyuttaṃ, vassate sabbakālikaṃ.","tha-ap492:20.1":"“‘Aṭṭhārase kappasate, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap492:20.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap492:21.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo, oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap492:21.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, nibbāyissatināsavo.","tha-ap492:22.1":"“‘Dhammaṃ abhisamentassa, sālacchannaṃ bhavissati;","tha-ap492:22.3":"Citake jhāyamānassa, chadanaṃ tattha hessati’.","tha-ap492:23.1":"“Vipākaṃ kittayitvāna, piyadassī mahāmuni;","tha-ap492:23.3":"Parisāya dhammaṃ desesi, tappento dhammavuṭṭhiyā.","tha-ap492:24.1":"“Tiṃsakappāni devesu, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap492:24.3":"Saṭṭhi ca sattakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap492:25.1":"“Devalokā idhāgantvā, labhāmi vipulaṃ sukhaṃ;","tha-ap492:25.3":"Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, maṇḍapassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap492:26.1":"“Ayaṃ pacchimako mayhaṃ, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap492:26.3":"Idhāpi sālacchadanaṃ, hessati sabbakālikaṃ.","tha-ap492:27.1":"“Mahāmuniṃ tosayitvā, gotamaṃ sakyapuṅgavaṃ;","tha-ap492:27.3":"Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap492:28.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap492:28.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap492:29.1":"Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap492:30.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap492:31.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap492:32.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sālamaṇḍapiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap492:33.1":"Sālamaṇḍapiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap492:34.1":"Paṃsukūlavaggo ekūnapaññāsamo.","tha-ap492:35.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap492:36.1":"Paṃsukūlaṃ buddhasaññī, bhisado ñāṇakittako;","tha-ap492:36.3":"Candanī dhātupūjī ca, pulinuppādakopi ca.","tha-ap492:37.1":"Taraṇo dhammaruciko, sālamaṇḍapiyo tathā;","tha-ap492:37.3":"Satāni dve honti gāthā, ūnavīsatimeva ca."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
